  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes And/Or building expressions EF Core could not translate, filters silently duplicating when a filter object was reused, and AndIf/OrIf being ignored by Apply(). Adds ToPagedResult with total count, multi-column and nested-property sorting, MaxPageSize, Search across columns, WhereIfNotEmpty/WhereIfHasValue, and programmatic configuration. Existing AddFilter code is unaffected. See CHANGELOG.md.",
